    "text": "<p>One mole of an ideal gas at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is taken from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> as shown in the given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></math> indicator diagram. The work done by the system will be _______&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;[Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mole</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6931</mn></math>] (Round off to the nearest integer)</p><p>(Round off to the nearest integer)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ed0a09f8-b185-4bbb-965c-cf5ebc80fb78-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 230px;\" /></p>",
